{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/123-you-di-zhi-du/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/123-you-di-zhi-du/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 有杕之杜 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 唐風 · 有杕之杜 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《有杕之杜》的 4 条注释，含 4 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"123-you-di-zhi-du","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/123-you-di-zhi-du/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"123-you-di-zhi-du","title":"有杕之杜","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"tangfeng","path":["風","唐風","有杕之杜"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"有杕之杜","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"生于道左","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"彼君子兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"噬肯適我","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"中心好之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"曷飲食之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"有杕之杜","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"生于道周","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"彼君子兮","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"噬肯來遊","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"中心好之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"曷飲食之","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":4,"glossCount":4},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"自嗟無力致賢也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 篇首题注。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《有杕之杜》二章，章六句。《集傳》以爲「此人好賢而恐不足以致之」，其説固是。然詩中具有二義，本意云，吾勢雖不足以致賢，而心則誠好之，但不知如何而後能飲食致敬，聊表好賢之誠，使天下賢俊顧我而來遊乎？言外見彼有勢力，足以致賢者，富貴而尊顯之，爲願所適，無施不可，而又不肯禮賢下士，以致仁人君子居貞遠遯，不肯來遊，是誰過歟？天下事好者無力，而有力者不好，則亦末如之何也已矣。故《序》以爲「刺武公不求賢以自輔」，雖未必遽見爲然，而凡爲武公者，可以反己自思矣。","targetNotes":"总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"噬發語辭。曷何也。周曲也。〔孔氏穎達曰〕言道周繞之，故爲曲也。","targetNotes":"集释原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集釋"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"左二十哿。我同。本韻。好二十號。食四寘。叶韻。周十一尤。遊同。本韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"標韻"}]}]}}}
